litcal

This product includes calendar rules and data derived from LiturgicalCalendarAPI
(https://github.com/Liturgical-Calendar/LiturgicalCalendarAPI), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The files in internal/definitions/data and internal/i18n/data were converted from its jsondata/sourcedata/rite/roman and
i18n folders, and the celebration names in internal/i18n/data were then corrected. The calendar rules were rewritten in Go
from its PHP sources.
